      "name": "search_businesses",
      "description": "Create a saved Maps campaign; public-source work may reserve/spend credits. All mode uses the wallet with null cap/budget. maximum_credit_units is in half-credit units (2 units = 1 credit).\n\n        Contact choice: enrichment=true alone is Businesses + available emails (the default: every business is kept, 1 credit with an email, 0.5 without; the target counts businesses). only_with_email=true (or result_mode=\"emails\") is Only with email (1 credit per business with an email, the others left out and not charged). enrichment=false is No emails (0.5 credit per business).",
